Server init.
>> a := Blob nobo: 4.
a bytes: ( Lista nobo ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob nobo: 4.
b bytes: ( Lista nobo ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a nobo.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Salida skirbi: ( a ^ c ), liña-nobo. } kapta: { :e Salida skirbi: e, liña-nobo. }, kuminsá.
a libra.
b libra.
